<title>NEW ZEALAND: No Air NZ announcement tonight - spokesman.</title>
<headline>No Air NZ announcement tonight - spokesman.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air New Zealand Ltd spokesman David Beatson said there would be no announcement about its proposed buy into Ansett Airlines tonight (Wednesday).</p>
<p>&quot;We are still not in a position to make an announcement as of tonight,&quot; Beatson told Reuters.</p>
<p>Air NZ has been seeking TNT Ltd's 50 percent stake in Ansett and sources in Australia have indicated some movement in the protracted negotiation may be imminent.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
</text>
